@startuml Kasir_Lihat_Riwayat
!theme plain
title SD: Kasir — Lihat Riwayat Transaksi
actor Kasir
participant "App (Flutter)\nKasirScreen" as App
participant "Backend" as API
database "Database" as DB

Kasir -> App: Klik Tab "Riwayat"
App -> API: GET /kasir/transactions/{kasir_uid}
API -> DB: SELECT orders\nWHERE is_offline = 1\nAND user_id = kasir_uid\nORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 50
DB --> API: List transaksi

API -> DB: SELECT SUM(total), COUNT(*)\nFROM orders\nWHERE is_offline = 1\nAND user_id = kasir_uid\nAND DATE(created_at) = CURDATE()
DB --> API: today_total, today_count

API --> App: {today_total, today_count, transactions[]}
App --> Kasir: Tampil kartu ringkasan:\n"Pendapatan Tunai Hari Ini"\n(total Rp & jumlah transaksi)

App --> Kasir: Tampil daftar riwayat transaksi\n(Order #ID, nama pelanggan, total, waktu)

alt Kasir klik Pull-to-Refresh
    Kasir -> App: Tarik ke bawah (swipe down)
    App -> API: GET /kasir/transactions/{kasir_uid}
    API --> App: Data terbaru
    App --> Kasir: Daftar diperbarui
end

@enduml
